---
const modules = [
  { name: '視覺練習', selected: true },
  { name: '動作練習' },
  { name: '認知練習' },
  { name: '口腔練習' },
];
---
<figure class="trainerhub-preview">
  <div class="ss-stage trainerhub-stage" data-fidelity="realistic" aria-hidden="true">
    <!-- Browser geometry adapted from stageshow/kit/window; rendered as static Astro. -->
    <div class="ss-window trainerhub-window" data-lights="grey">
      <div class="ss-window__bar">
        <span class="ss-window__lights"><span class="ss-window__dot"></span><span class="ss-window__dot"></span><span class="ss-window__dot"></span></span>
        <span class="ss-window__url">trainerhub.cc</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ss-window__body">
        <div class="preview-main">
          <p class="preview-title">選擇練習類別</p>
          <div class="preview-modules">
            {modules.map((module) => (
              <div class:list={['preview-module', { 'is-selected': module.selected }]}>
                <strong>{module.name}</strong>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
          <div class="preview-workflow"><span>設定參數</span><span>進行練習</span><span>匯出成績</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>TrainerHub 功能示意，實際練習請前往平台。</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .trainerhub-preview {
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .trainerhub-stage {
    --preview-gutter: 24px;
    padding: var(--preview-gutter) 0 var(--preview-gutter) var(--preview-gutter);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .trainerhub-window {
    width: calc(100% + 48px);
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--line), var(--shadow);
  }

  .ss-window__bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    height: 38px;
    padding: 0 14.5px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--surface-soft);
  }

  .ss-window__lights {
    display: flex;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .ss-window__dot {
    width: 9px;
    height: 9px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-border-strong);
  }

  .ss-window__url {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    margin-left: 8px;
    padding: 2px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--font-size-small);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .preview-main {
    padding: 28px 76px 28px 28px;
  }

  .preview-title {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .preview-modules {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .preview-module {
    padding: 20px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 7px;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .preview-module strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .preview-module.is-selected {
    border-color: transparent;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--color-badge-text);
  }

  .preview-workflow {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px 16px;
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: var(--font-size-small);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .preview-workflow span {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  figcaption {
    margin: 0 0 0 24px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--font-size-small);
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .preview-main {
      padding: 20px 64px 20px 16px;
    }

    .preview-module {
      padding: 16px 10px;
    }
  }
</style>
